  "prefLabel": "He-P 2702.01 Application Submission",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-12-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 2702.01 Application Submission.\n\n(a) A milk producer shall complete and submit a signed and dated “Application for Milk Producer Permit” Form MPAPP (01-01-17) application to the department for a producer permit required under RSA 184:88.\n\n(b) Upon receipt of a signed and dated “Application for a Milk Producer Permit” Form MPAPP (01-01-17) for a milk producer permit, the commissioner shall approve or deny the application in accordance with procedures set forth in RSA 184:89, RSA 184:90, RSA 184:91, and He-P 2702.02 through He-P 2702.04.\n\nSource. #5695, eff 8-26-93, EXPIRED: 8-26-99\n\nNew. #7315, eff 7-1-00; ss by #9189, INTERIM, eff 7-1-08, EXPIRES: 12-28-08; ss by #9325, eff 11-21-08; ss by #12101, eff 2-3-17; ss by #13175, eff 3-2-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p2700.html"
